```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "mint a place's carrier seal and floor pin for the kahu"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///carriage.place.signs", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/carriage.place.signs"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/carriage.place.signs"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! carriage.place.signs ~ a herm signs with its vessel key alone

`lares nexus carry-for [nexus=<aid>] [out=<file>]` runs on the joining place: it reads the vessel key and nothing else (a herm holds no persona root) and mints the carrier seal the kahu supply to `nexus carry carrier=`. `out=` writes the floor pin claim and its KEL rows for `carry floor-pin=`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ sign

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`sign` params=`out/pin.json ~ mint the seal and write the floor pin`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ nexus · out

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ a carried charter this vessel holds; absent, the primary`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`out` params=`takes/host-path ~ the floor pin claim for carry floor-pin=`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/vessel ~ signs with this place's vessel key`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[carriage.place.signs out/pin.json]] ~ out= names no file`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ sealed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`sealed` params=`exit/0 ~ the carrier seal to hand the kahu`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares nexus carry-for

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares nexus carry-for]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

